## Curated non-free-firmware subset — Realtek + Intel NIC firmware only (locked decision).
##
## Debian does not split Intel ethernet firmware into its own package: the
## e100/igb/igc/ixgbe/i40e/ice blobs ship inside firmware-misc-nonfree, so that
## package is the minimal set that covers Intel NICs. firmware-realtek covers
## Realtek wired + WiFi NICs; firmware-iwlwifi covers Intel WiFi NICs.
## Verified in build/PACKAGE-VERIFY.md (trixie non-free-firmware, 20250410-2).
firmware-realtek
firmware-iwlwifi
firmware-misc-nonfree
